@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004

### Insert WFAudit record — replace 'workflow' with your actual service path
POST {{baseUrl}}/mdrapi/workflow/insertWFAudit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workflowId": "TRV-0001",
  "entityId": "T-0001",
  "operationType": "CREATE",
  "entityName": "Travels",
  "wfStage": "Approval",
  "action": "SUBMIT",
  "userRemarks": "Test entry from tests.http",
  "actioningUser": "myid@example.com"
}

### Resolve approvers — verify multi-row array output
POST {{baseUrl}}/mdrapi/workflow/resolveApprovers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tablename": "ZMDR_BPMASTER",
  "currentStage": "STAGE1",
  "processId": "TRV-0001",
  "requesterRole": "REQUESTOR",
  "requestorId": "myid@example.com",
  "apprClass": "TRAVEL_APPROVAL"
}